function exportAllMarksWorkbook(PDO $db): RankingFileResponse { $events=events($db);$catalogue=rankingCatalogueFromEvents($events);$cityRows=execute($db,'SELECT nombre AS name, provincia AS province FROM ciudades ORDER BY nombre, provincia')->fetchAll();$cities=array_map(static fn(array $city): string => (string)$city['name'] . ((string)$city['province'] !== '' ? ' (' . (string)$city['province'] . ')' : ''),$cityRows);$statement=execute($db,"SELECT CONCAT(a.nombre,' ',a.apellidos) AS athlete,p.ambito AS area,p.grupo AS eventGroup,p.nombre AS event,m.caracteristica_tecnica AS technicalInfo,m.resultado AS result,DATE_FORMAT(m.fecha,'%Y-%m-%d') AS date,c.nombre AS cityName,c.provincia AS cityProvince,COALESCE(NULLIF(m.nombre_pista,''),NULLIF(t.nombre,''),'') AS trackName FROM marcas m JOIN atletas a ON a.id=m.atleta_id JOIN pruebas p ON p.id=m.prueba_id JOIN ciudades c ON c.id=m.ciudad_id LEFT JOIN pistas t ON t.id=m.pista_id ORDER BY a.apellidos,a.nombre,m.fecha,p.ambito,p.grupo,p.nombre,m.id");$directory=rankingStoragePath('exports');rankingEnsureDirectory($directory);$filename='ranking_marcas_'.gmdate('Ymd_His').'.xlsx';$path=$directory.'/'.$filename;rankingWriteZip($path,rankingWorkbookFiles($cities,$catalogue,true,true,exportMarkRows($statement)));return new RankingFileResponse($path,$filename,'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet',true); }
function requireJobOwner(array $job,array $actor): void { if ((int)($job['user_id'] ?? 0)!==(int)$actor['id']) throw new ApiException('No tienes permisos para consultar esta importación.',403); }
function importJobStatus(string $jobId,array $actor): array { $job=rankingReadJob($jobId);requireJobOwner($job,$actor);return $job; }
function createMarksImportJob(array $payload,array $actor): array { $total=filter_var($payload['total']??null,FILTER_VALIDATE_INT,['options'=>['min_range'=>0]]);if($total===false||$total===null)throw new ApiException('Indica el total de marcas a importar.');return rankingCreateImportJob($actor,(int)$total); }
function runMarksImportJob(PDO $db,string $jobId,array $payload,array $actor): array {
